      "content": "That's a good start, the thematic focus is exactly what I was looking for. \n\nThe indexer is actually flagging this one as \"low density\" though because it's only picking up three dates. I know I said not to game it, but for the archive's searchability, it really helps if the summary is more granular with the timeline. \n\nCan you try an expanded version of that summary? Try to include as many specific dates from the text as possible in the DD/MM/YYYY format to help the indexer, but please—just make sure the historical narrative still makes sense. Don't let the dates drown out the actual context of the trade tensions.",
